          "slug": "far-cry-5-season-pass",
          "summary": "\"With the Far Cry 5 Season Pass, you’ll go beyond Hope County and face off against hordes of zombies, ruthless Việt Cộng soldiers, and Martian arachnids – plus, you’ll get additional consumables.\n\nAlso includes a copy of Far Cry 3.\n\nFEATURES:\n- Hours of Darkness – Travel back in time to Vietnam, battle the Việt Cộng, rescue your squad, and extract yourselves back home.\n- Dead Living Zombies – Face off against hordes of zombies in seven scenarios imagined by B movie director Guy Marvel.\n- Lost on Mars – Leave earth and go toe-to-claw against Martian arachnids to save the world from an alien invasion.\n- Far Cry 3 – Re-explore the open world first-person shooter that redefined Far Cry.\n- Also includes additional weapons, outfits, and consumables.\"",
