          "slug": "far-cry-5-resistance-edition",
          "status": 6,
          "summary": "Brought to you in collaboration with Tri-Force, the Far Cry 5 Resistance Edition includes five exclusive, iconic Hope County collectibles and a copy of the Far Cry 5 SteelBook Gold Edition game. An instant collector's item, the Far Cry 5 Resistance Edition is exclusively available at GameStop in limited quantities. Don't wait - join the Resistance today!\n\nFar Cry 5 Resistance Edition includes:\n\nFar Cry 5 SteelBook Gold Edition game, including all Deluxe add-on content, the Season Pass, and a collectible SteelBook case.\n\n16.5-inch premium statue featuring highly detailed reproductions of Resistance members Nick Rye and Boomer the dog.\n\nHigh-quality Hope County flag bandana and logo pin collectibles so you can wear your allegiance for all to see.\n\nA souvenir Koozie and a set of three exclusive postcards to commemorate your trip to Hope County.\n\nPremium collector's box packaging.",
